  "id": "indirect-associations",
  "term": "indirect associations",
  "definition": "Indirect associations are relationships between two variables that are partly explained by one or more other factors linking them. In this packet, the connection between Internet use and health is described as indirect when part of that relationship operates through social participation and physical activity rather than only through a direct link.",
